# Check out text files with LF on every OS. Git for Windows' default (core.autocrlf=true) would give CRLF,
# and Terraform's file() sends the SQL to Flink byte for byte: a Windows deploy would change every statement's
# text (and replace it on the next apply from a Mac), and replace() in airline-demo/main.tf would stop matching.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files git can't always tell from their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
